cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use these scripts, please cite the data descriptor.
title: Analysis pipeline for 183 infectious bronchitis virus genomes from the Republic of Korea
abstract: >-
  Read checking, de novo assembly, contig finishing, annotation with the replicase frameshift
  located per genome, S1 lineage assignment and quality control for the 183 IBV genomes
  deposited under BioProject PRJNA1537317, with the scripts that produce the tables and
  figures of the data descriptor.
type: software
license: MIT
